    zhouyi   pick one of the 64 hexagrams
    tarot    pick one of the 78 cards plus upright/reversed
    fortune  pick one of the 7 luck grades with its one-line meaning
    dice     roll `count` d`sides` and add `modifier`

Arguments arrive as one JSON object on stdin (also MIYU_ARGS_JSON):
    {"method":"dice","count":2,"sides":20,"modifier":3}
"""

